# A resize, restore or revert proceeds while the remediation holds the
# reservation.
MODULE: ReservationExcludesAliasChangesMoveDuringRemediation
TARGET: ReservationExcludesAliasChanges
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a resize or restore moves the tree under a running remediation
PERTURBS: Move

--- FIND
    /\ ~moved /\ reserved = "None" /\ nextId <= MaxCopy
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~moved /\ nextId <= MaxCopy
--- END
